                "text": "I joined my CA and Tri-caucus colleagues yesterday to make two things clear:\n\u00a0\n1. I am fighting for, and will always stand with, our immigrant communities as they peacefully exercise their right to protest.\u00a0\u00a0\n\u00a0\n2. Trump\u2019s deployment of U.S. Marines to Los Angeles is a gimmick to raise tensions and feed a violent narrative about our communities.",
